{
  "id": "data-story-60s",
  "title": "Data story (22 s cut)",
  "useFor": "A short data-journalism beat: a question, the answer shown as one icon per person, a globe for 'where', and a single takeaway number. Replace the figures with your own; extend a scene or add a chart to reach 60 s.",
  "format": "landscape",
  "background": "#0B1020",
  "tags": [
    "data",
    "story",
    "statistics",
    "infographic",
    "journalism",
    "chart",
    "numbers",
    "percent",
    "population",
    "isotype",
    "globe",
    "insight",
    "explainer",
    "report",
    "takeaway"
  ],
  "scenes": [
    {
      "duration": 130,
      "transition": {
        "type": "wipe",
        "direction": "from-right",
        "frames": 14
      },
      "layers": [
        {
          "motion": "kinetic-type-slam",
          "props": {
            "lines": [
              {
                "text": "If the world",
                "accent": "world"
              },
              {
                "text": "were 100 people",
                "accent": "100"
              }
            ],
            "beatFrames": 10,
            "holdBeats": 2,
            "layout": "stack",
            "capHeight": 0.2,
            "background": "#0B1020",
            "ink": "#F2F4FA",
            "accent": "#FF7A3C",
            "flash": false,
            "showIndex": false,
            "push": 0.03
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "duration": 210,
      "transition": {
        "type": "iris",
        "frames": 16
      },
      "layers": [
        {
          "motion": "isotype-count",
          "props": {
            "title": "Where do they live?",
            "count": 100,
            "highlight": 57,
            "unitValue": 1,
            "unitLabel": "of 100 people",
            "highlightLabel": "live in cities",
            "icon": "person",
            "arrangement": "grid",
            "color": "#7CA6E8",
            "accent": "#FF7A3C",
            "background": "#0B1020",
            "ink": "#F2F4FA",
            "bpm": 120
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "duration": 200,
      "transition": {
        "type": "fade",
        "frames": 14
      },
      "layers": [
        {
          "motion": "globe-3d",
          "props": {
            "background": "#0B1020",
            "backgroundEdge": "#16264d",
            "focus": {
              "lat": 30,
              "lon": 100,
              "at": 90,
              "label": "Asia",
              "zoom": 1.35
            },
            "arcColor": "#FF7A3C",
            "markerColor": "#FFE1C9",
            "stars": true
          }
        },
        {
          "motion": "number-counter",
          "props": {
            "layout": "hud",
            "keyframes": [
              [
                0,
                0
              ],
              [
                20,
                0
              ],
              [
                130,
                57
              ],
              [
                200,
                57
              ]
            ],
            "mode": "tick",
            "label": "LIVE IN CITIES",
            "unit": "%",
            "readouts": [],
            "backdrop": "none",
            "numberColor": "#F2F4FA",
            "labelColor": "#9FB0D6",
            "accent": "#FF7A3C",
            "size": 210
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "duration": 150,
      "layers": [
        {
          "motion": "kinetic-type-slam",
          "props": {
            "lines": [
              {
                "text": "Most of us",
                "accent": "Most"
              },
              {
                "text": "live in cities",
                "accent": "cities"
              }
            ],
            "beatFrames": 10,
            "holdBeats": 2.5,
            "layout": "stack",
            "capHeight": 0.2,
            "background": "#0B1020",
            "ink": "#F2F4FA",
            "accent": "#FF7A3C",
            "flash": false,
            "showIndex": false,
            "push": 0.03
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Illustrative figures (about 57 of every 100 people live in cities): replace them with your own sourced numbers and name the source on screen or in the narration. isotype-count: count, highlight, unitValue, unitLabel, icon (person | drop | house | cup | box | tree), arrangement (grid | bar | row | heart). globe-3d: points / arcs / focus for the geography; number-counter: keyframes, label, unit. For a 60-second version add scenes: dot-tally for a second comparison, axis-ratchet-rescale for a time series, painted-choropleth or map-route for the map."
}